Text:
This design is about operations involving a single Fearless project; the location of this Fearless project is the Base16 in scope.
The 'name' of a Fearless project is ProjectName when ProjectName ".fearless" is the only file at top level in that Fearless project ending with ".fearless".
fearlessProject$checkWellShaped has no Define: fearlessProject$checkWellShaped ends with done when the Fearless project at Base16 is 'well shaped' as tasks/FolderShapesDesign defines, and otherwise ends with the Error that a compilation of the Fearless project at Base16 gives.

Grammar:
FearlessPath ::= ("/" ValidSegment)*
File ::= (FearlessPath->Content)
RankFileName ::= "_rank_" RankLevel ".fear" | "_rank_" RankLevel [0-9][0-9][0-9] ".fear"
RankLevel ::= "base" | "core" | "driver" | "worker" | "framework" | "accumulator" | "tool" | "app"
Out ::= ("json"->Content1) ("jar"->Content2) ("html"->Content3) ("txt"->Content4)
LowerJson ::= (PackageName->Content)
CompileResult ::= Out | "error(" Str ")"
OutExtension ::= ".json" | ".jar" | ".html" | ".txt" | ".unfinished"

Define fearlessProject$allPaths:
A action return the set of the DeskPaths at Base16 or inside Base16

Define fearlessProject$visiblePaths:
A action return the set of the DeskPaths of fearlessProject$allPaths where no Segment after Base16 starts with "."

Define fearlessProject$fearlessFiles:
A action return the set of the Files that Fearless code sees inside Base16, including the Files inside zip files

Define fearlessProject$fearless_out:
A action return the set of the names of the files directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16

Define fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("x"->Content):
A action create the folder .fearless_out when Base16 has no folder .fearless_out
B action write the file x holding Content directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16; a file x that is there is replaced, and the file x gets a new modification time

Define fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "x":
A action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("x"->Content), with the empty Content

Define fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "x":
A action delete the file x directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16; nothing happens when no file x is there

Define fearlessProject$checkIsUpToDate:
A if "_compile_start.txt" not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
B if the modification time of a DeskPath in fearlessProject$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "_compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
C action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
D if one of PackageName1 ".jar" .. PackageNamen ".jar" is not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)
E if one of PackageName1 ".unfinished" .. PackageNamen ".unfinished" is in fearlessProject$fearless_out, error fearlessProjectErrorIsOutOfDate(Base16)

Define fearlessProject$compile:
A action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= "_compile_start.txt"
B action wait until the clock of the file system of Base16 is after the modification time of "_compile_start.txt"
C action fearlessProject$checkWellShaped
D action fearlessProject$cleanup
E action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
F action fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageName1) .. fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageNamen)

Define fearlessProject$cleanup:
A action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= "x", for each "x" in fearlessProject$fearless_out that is not "_compile_start.txt" and is not of form PackageNamei OutExtension for an i in 1..n

Define fearlessProject$packages:
A action return each PackageName where fearlessProject$files(PackageName) is not empty, ordered by fearlessProject$rank(PackageName), then by PackageName

Define fearlessProject$lower(PackageName):
A action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return the list of "base" and of each PackageNamei where fearlessProject$rank(PackageNamei) < fearlessProject$rank(PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$higher(PackageName):
A action fearlessProject$packages = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return the list of each PackageNamei where fearlessProject$rank(PackageNamei) > fearlessProject$rank(PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$lowerJsons(PackageName):
A action fearlessProject$lower(PackageName) = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action return (PackageName1->fearlessProject$json(PackageName1)) .. (PackageNamen->fearlessProject$json(PackageNamen))

Define fearlessProject$json(PackageName):
A fact PackageName is "base"
B action return fearlessProject$jsonBase

Define fearlessProject$json(PackageName):
A fact PackageName is not "base"
B action return the Content of the file PackageName ".json" directly inside the folder .fearless_out of Base16

Define fearlessProject$files(PackageName):
A action return fearlessProject$fearlessFiles.filter(File->File.FearlessPath.contains("/_" PackageName "/"))

Define fearlessProject$rankFiles:
A action return fearlessProject$fearlessFiles.filter(File->File.FearlessPath is of form FearlessPath "/" RankFileName)

Define fearlessProject$rank(PackageName):
A fact (FearlessPath "/_" PackageName FearlessPath' "/" RankFileName->Content) in fearlessProject$rankFiles
B action return frontend.rank(FearlessPath "/_" PackageName FearlessPath' "/" RankFileName)

Define fearlessProject$sharedZips:
A action return fearlessProject$visiblePaths.filter(DeskPath->DeskPath is a zip file and no Segment of DeskPath is of form "_" PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$compilePackage(PackageName):
A if PackageName ".unfinished" in fearlessProject$fearless_out, return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
B if PackageName ".jar" not in fearlessProject$fearless_out, return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
C if the modification time of a DeskPath of fearlessProject$visiblePaths of form DeskPath' "_" PackageName Segment1 .. Segmentn is after the modification time of PackageName ".jar", return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
D if the modification time of a DeskPath of fearlessProject$sharedZips is after the modification time of PackageName ".jar", return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)
E if frontend.mapsChanged(PackageName,fearlessProject$rankFiles,fearlessProject$json(PackageName)), return fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName)

Define fearlessProject$forceCompilePackage(PackageName):
A action fearlessProject$higher(PackageName) = PackageName1 .. PackageNamen
B action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= PackageName ".unfinished"
C action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= PackageName ".jar"
D action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= PackageName1 ".jar" .. fearlessProject$fearless_out-= PackageNamen ".jar"
E fact frontend.compile(PackageName,fearlessProject$files(PackageName),fearlessProject$rankFiles,fearlessProject$lowerJsons(PackageName)) = CompileResult
F if CompileResult = "error(" Str ")", error fearlessProjectErrorPackageDoesNotCompile(PackageName,Str)
G fact CompileResult = ("json"->Content1) ("jar"->Content2) ("html"->Content3) ("txt"->Content4)
H action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= (PackageName ".json"->Content1)
I action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= (PackageName ".html"->Content3)
J action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= (PackageName ".txt"->Content4)
K action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= (PackageName ".jar"->Content2)
L action wait until the clock of the file system of Base16 is after the modification time of PackageName ".jar"
M if the modification time of a DeskPath in fearlessProject$visiblePaths is after the modification time of "_compile_start.txt", error fearlessProjectErrorFilesChangedDuringCompile(Base16)
N action fearlessProject$fearless_out-= PackageName ".unfinished"
